      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "String\n    + charAt()\n    + getChars(int srcstart, int srcend, char[] target, int trgtstart)\n    + toCharArray()\n    + byte[] getBytes()\n\n    * toString() <-- to define what is the object as a string\n    * String.valueOf(Object) <-- make anything into a string\n\n● trim(), length()\n\n● boolean equals(Object str)\n\n● boolean equalsIgnoreCase(String str)\n\n● boolean regionMatches(int startIndex, String str2, int str2StartIndex, int numChars)\n\n● boolean regionMatches(boolean ignoreCase, int startIndex, String str2, int str2StartIndex, int numChars)\n\n● boolean startsWith(String str)\n\n● boolean endsWith(String str)\n\n● int compareTo(String str)\n    – < 0 implies the invoking string is less than str.\n    – > 0 implies the invoking string is greater than str.\n    – = 0 implies two strings are equal.\n\n\n● int indexOf(int ch)\n● int indexOf(String str)\n● int indexOf(int ch, int startIndex)\n● int indexOf(String str, int startIndex)\n\n● int lastIndexOf(String str)\n● int lastIndexOf(int ch)\n● int lastIndexOf(int ch, int startIndex)\n● int lastIndexOf(String str, int startIndex) ",
      "fontSize": 16.000000000000004,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "String\n    + charAt()\n    + getChars(int srcstart, int srcend, char[] target, int trgtstart)\n    + toCharArray()\n    + byte[] getBytes()\n\n    * toString() <-- to define what is the object as a string\n    * String.valueOf(Object) <-- make anything into a string\n\n● trim(), length()\n\n● boolean equals(Object str)\n\n● boolean equalsIgnoreCase(String str)\n\n● boolean regionMatches(int startIndex, String str2, int str2StartIndex, int numChars)\n\n● boolean regionMatches(boolean ignoreCase, int startIndex, String str2, int str2StartIndex, int numChars)\n\n● boolean startsWith(String str)\n\n● boolean endsWith(String str)\n\n● int compareTo(String str)\n    – < 0 implies the invoking string is less than str.\n    – > 0 implies the invoking string is greater than str.\n    – = 0 implies two strings are equal.\n\n\n● int indexOf(int ch)\n● int indexOf(String str)\n● int indexOf(int ch, int startIndex)\n● int indexOf(String str, int startIndex)\n\n● int lastIndexOf(String str)\n● int lastIndexOf(int ch)\n● int lastIndexOf(int ch, int startIndex)\n● int lastIndexOf(String str, int startIndex) ",
