      "text": "old gui library before swing\nheavyweight (because uses native code resources)\nuses os resource components directly -> drawn by OS\nmight look or act differently on OSs\nthreatens \"write once use anywhere\"\nrectangular and opaque always",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "old gui library before swing\nheavyweight (because uses native code resources)\nuses os resource components directly -> drawn by OS\nmight look or act differently on OSs\nthreatens \"write once use anywhere\"\nrectangular and opaque always",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
