      "updated": 1764710395947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JFrame\n    top-level window with a title bar and window controls.\n    may have menus, panels, etc.\n    forms the outer shell mostly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JFrame\n    top-level window with a title bar and window controls.\n    may have menus, panels, etc.\n    forms the outer shell mostly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kq2XsQiYl8ITfd0DtV2fx",
      "type": "text",
