      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+ Component: an independent visual control\n+ Container: special type of component that holds a group of components\n+ A component must be held within a container in order to be displayed\n\n+ Every top-level container defines a set of panes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
