    {
      "id": "ZyaiuW3ai7p50-Tc2Qcho",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6717.9988486346965,
      "y": -1275.807373067383,
      "width": 780.9989624023438,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Epk2QiRKv2aXEOyzfPgDJ"
      ],
      "frameId": "nhD0KvUbeV3DHbHHQxhU7",
      "index": "b0LV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002932136,
      "version": 1045,
      "versionNonce": 345483764,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764698042430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bool thread.isALive()\n    is the thread running?\n\nvoid thread.join()\n    wait for thread to finish. paused till thread completes\n    additional forms of join allow a max time to wait upto.\n\nvoid thread.setPriority(int n)\n    set priority btw 1-10 default 5\n    thread.MIN_PRIORITY|NORM_PRIORITY|MAX_PRIORITY\n\nint thread.getPriority()\n\nvoid thread.setName(string s)\n\nstring thread.getName()\n\nvoid thread.run()\n    define the code thread will execute\n    calling it runs it as a normal method in same thread(no new thread)\n\nvoid thread.start()\n    initiate a new thread and call run() on it\n\nvoid Thread.sleep()\n    sleep the thread; STATIC or Thread.currentThread().sleep()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "bool thread.isALive()\n    is the thread running?\n\nvoid thread.join()\n    wait for thread to finish. paused till thread completes\n    additional forms of join allow a max time to wait upto.\n\nvoid thread.setPriority(int n)\n    set priority btw 1-10 default 5\n    thread.MIN_PRIORITY|NORM_PRIORITY|MAX_PRIORITY\n\nint thread.getPriority()\n\nvoid thread.setName(string s)\n\nstring thread.getName()\n\nvoid thread.run()\n    define the code thread will execute\n    calling it runs it as a normal method in same thread(no new thread)\n\nvoid thread.start()\n    initiate a new thread and call run() on it\n\nvoid Thread.sleep()\n    sleep the thread; STATIC or Thread.currentThread().sleep()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ufbGBqXNcjMu-4Yy8XzWR",
      "type": "text",
