      "text": "monitor is an object actin as a\nmutex\n\nonly one thread can own the\nmonitor at a time\n\nthread owning a monitor can re-\nenter if needed",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "monitor is an object actin as a mutex\n\nonly one thread can own the monitor at a time\n\nthread owning a monitor can re-enter if needed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
