      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "java.util.Queue interface\n\n1. add(E e)\n\nAdds an element to the queue; throws an exception if the queue is full.\n\n2. offer(E e)\n\nAdds an element to the queue; returns false if the queue is full (safer than add()).\n\n3. remove()\n\nRemoves and returns the head element; throws exception if the queue is empty.\n\n4. poll()\n\nRemoves and returns the head element; returns null if the queue is empty.\n\n5. element()\n\nReturns (but does not remove) the head; throws exception if empty.\n\n6. peek()\n\nReturns (but does not remove) the head; returns null if empty.\n\n7. size()\n\nReturns the number of elements in the queue.\n\n8. isEmpty()\n\nChecks if the queue has no elements.\n\n9. clear()\n\nRemoves all elements from the queue.",
      "fontSize": 6.107786643182742,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "java.util.Queue interface\n\n1. add(E e)\n\nAdds an element to the queue; throws an exception if the queue is full.\n\n2. offer(E e)\n\nAdds an element to the queue; returns false if the queue is full (safer than add()).\n\n3. remove()\n\nRemoves and returns the head element; throws exception if the queue is empty.\n\n4. poll()\n\nRemoves and returns the head element; returns null if the queue is empty.\n\n5. element()\n\nReturns (but does not remove) the head; throws exception if empty.\n\n6. peek()\n\nReturns (but does not remove) the head; returns null if empty.\n\n7. size()\n\nReturns the number of elements in the queue.\n\n8. isEmpty()\n\nChecks if the queue has no elements.\n\n9. clear()\n\nRemoves all elements from the queue.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
